  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>28</span><font>2024.06</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>信创 | 信创产业数字化转型与升级：路径规划与实践！</h2> <b>2024.06.28</b> <h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">信创产业的数字化转型与升级路径，主要围绕着构建国产化信息技术软硬件底层架构体系和全周期生态体系，解决核心技术关键环节“卡脖子”的问题，以推动中国经济数字化转型的平稳健康发展。</span></h1><h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></h1><h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">万里数据库作为国产数据库知名企业，专注于解决关键技术“卡脖子”问题，加速关键核心技术研发突破，以深度掌控底层核心代码的数据库技术优势，助力国家打好关键核心技术攻坚战。</h1><h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">积极打造自主创新的一站式数据库产品及解决方案，助力金融、运营商、能源、交通等涉及国计民生的重点行业超1000+客户实现数字化智能化转型升级，为产业数字化发展积淀实践价值，推动数字中国建设，助力数字经济高质量发展。<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 82, 255); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br/></span></h1><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></span></p><p><br/></p><p></p><section><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">一、信创产业的发展趋势包括：</span></strong></section><p></p><p><br/></p><ol class=\" list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.2em; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">加强国产信息技术软硬件基础设施产品的综合能力</span>：通过应用牵引与产业培育，不断提升国产信息技术软硬件基础设施产品的综合能力，实现自主可控、安全可靠的发展目标。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">推动数字产业化和产业数字化</span>：关注数字经济三大方向：数字产业化、产业数字化、数据价值化。加快推动数字产业化，推进产业数字化转型，建立健全数据要素市场规则。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">构建信创产业生态</span>：加速构建信创产业生态，助力企业数字化转型。这包括促进信创产业与数字经济的加速融合，以及通过创新驱动发展，提升产业链水平。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">利用新技术和理念提高效率、降低成本</span>：在数字化转型的过程中，企业普遍采用新技术和理念，旨在提高效率、降低成本，并推动企业由传统业务模式向数字化业务模式的演进。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">探索适合自身的数字化路径</span>：钉钉等智能化协同工具和数字化底座的成功案例，为更多企业探索适合自身的数字化路径提供了宝贵的经验。</span></p></li></ol><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">综上所述，信创产业的数字化转型与升级路径涉及多个方面，包括加强国产化技术能力、推动数字产业化与产业数字化、构建信创产业生态、利用新技术提高效率、探索个性化数字化路径以及重视自主可控等关键策略。这些策略共同作用，旨在推动信创产业的持续发展和中国经济的数字化转型。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></p><h4 style=\"margin: 16px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 400; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">二、信创产业在哪些具体技术领域面临“卡脖子”的问题，以及如何通过国产化解决方案来解决这些问题？</span></strong></h4><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">信创产业在多个具体技术领域面临“卡脖子”的问题，主要包括服务器芯片、基础设施（如CPU）、以及整个IT生态的构建等方面。具体来说：</span></p><ol class=\" list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.2em; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">服务器芯片</span>：服务器芯片是信创落地的基石，其国产化是解决技术瓶颈的关键一步。目前，中国在CPU的国产选择上主要有海光、兆芯、鲲鹏、飞腾、龙芯、中威等品牌，这些品牌的芯片基于X86授权开发，标志着在服务器芯片领域国产化的进展。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">基础设施国产化</span>：基础设施的国产化是信创产业发展的另一个重要方面。CPU作为核心要件，如果不能实现国产化，那么其他方面的国产化进程也会受到影响。这表明，在基础设施层面，特别是处理器技术方面，信创产业面临着较大的挑战。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">IT生态构建</span>：信创产业的目的之一是围绕国产CPU形成完整的IT生态。这意味着，除了硬件的国产化外，还需要在软件、服务等多个层面实现自主可控，以构建一个健康、完整的国产化IT生态系统。</span></p></li></ol><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">为了解决这些问题，可以通过以下几个方面的国产化解决方案来推进：</span></p><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.2em; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">加强科技创新和研发投入</span>：需要更多硬核科技公司投身于对“卡脖子”核心技术的研发创新，甚至需要长期大力投入在基础科学研究上。这包括但不限于服务器芯片的研发、基础设施的优化升级，以及整个IT生态系统的构建和完善。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">明晰产业链上下游的对接适配标准</span>：构建国产化信息技术的软硬件架构体系，明晰产业链上下游的对接适配标准，有助于提高国产化产品的兼容性和互操作性。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">政策支持和市场引导</span>：政府可以通过政策支持和市场引导的方式，促进国产化进程。例如，通过提供研发补贴、税收优惠等措施，鼓励企业加大在关键技术研发上的投入；同时，通过政府采购政策等手段，优先采购国产化产品和服务，以扩大国产化产品的市场份额。</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">信创产业面临的“卡脖子”问题主要集中在服务器芯片、基础设施国产化以及IT生态构建等方面。通过加强科技创新、明晰产业链标准、以及政策支持和市场引导等措施，可以有效推动国产化解决方案的发展，解决这些技术瓶颈问题。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></span></p><h4 style=\"margin: 16px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 400; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">三、数字产业化和产业数字化转型的成功案例有哪些，它们是如何实现的？</span></strong></h4><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">数字产业化和产业数字化转型的成功案例包括多个领域和企业，它们通过不同的方式实现了转型和升级。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">在金融服务业方面，支付宝（蚂蚁）和微信是两个成功的数字化转型案例。这些企业通过提供面向个人的金融服务，利用数字技术优化了服务流程，提高了服务效率和用户体验。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">贝壳找房是居住服务行业的一个成功案例。它通过自我颠覆的整合式创新，实现了产业数字化转型。从链家到贝壳找房的转变，不仅缩短了上市时间，还提升了在居住服务行业的竞争力。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">智能网联汽车的发展也是数字产业化的一个代表性案例。这一领域的实践展示了硬件、软件及其上层系统的深度融合，推动了数字经济的发展。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">此外，华为企业业务发布的100个行业智能化转型故事，涵盖了政府、交通、金融、能源等多个行业的智能化转型案例。这些案例展示了人工智能等技术如何深刻影响并改造人类社会。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">《数造新实体——数字技术赋能实体经济案例研究（2023年）》蓝皮书中的16个案例，也展示了数字技术如何赋能实体经济，推动产业升级和转型。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">这些成功案例的共同点在于，它们都充分利用了数字技术，如大数据分析、人工智能、产业物联网等，来优化业务流程、提升服务质量和效率，以及创造新的商业模式和价值。通过这些技术的应用，企业能够更好地理解和满足客户需求，提高运营效率，从而实现数字化转型的成功。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></p><h4 style=\"margin: 16px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 400; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">四、如何构建有效的信创产业生态，以促进企业数字化转型？</span></strong></h4><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">构建有效的信创产业生态，以促进企业数字化转型，需要综合考虑多方面的因素和措施。以下是基于我搜索到的资料，提出的一些建议：</span></p><ol class=\" list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.2em; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">聚集创新资源与要素</span>：积极培养引进信息技术应用创新领域的专业人才，打造信创产业联盟，打通研发、生产、销售、服务各个环节。这有助于形成一个协同高效的生态系统，促进信息技术创新和应用。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">全产业链覆盖</span>：形成覆盖高性能芯片、操作系统、数据库、整机终端、系统集成、网络安全服务等全产业链的信创产业生态。这种全面的产业链布局能够确保企业在数字化转型过程中能够获得所需的各种技术和产品支持。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">规范化发展</span>：针对信创产业规范化欠缺的问题，需要建立公开的、硬性的认定标准。这有助于提升整个行业的透明度和信任度，吸引更多的企业参与到信创产业中来。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">科技创新升级换代</span>：通过各细分领域的科技创新升级换代，优化信创产业的创新环境，提升数字技术自强自立水平。这将为企业的数字化转型提供强大的技术支持和动力。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">多方协同</span>：中小企业在进行数字化转型时，应适时对转型进展和成效进行评估，因时因势优化转型策略，实现多方协同。这意味着企业不仅要关注自身的转型进程，还要与政府、行业协会、合作伙伴等多方共同协作，形成合力。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">开放生态共建</span>：通过开放生态，联合产业界合作伙伴，共建纵横双向生态，深入多行业，引领产业规模发展。这种开放的合作模式有助于快速集聚资源，加速产业生态的形成和发展。</span></p></li><li><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-weight: bold;\">知识产权保护</span>：推动信创产业发展，首先要实现生态先行，其中包括加强知识产权保护。保护知识产权是激励创新、保障公平竞争的重要手段，对于构建自主开放的新生态至关重要。</span></p></li></ol><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.6em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">构建有效的信创产业生态，需要从聚集创新资源、全产业链覆盖、规范化发展、科技创新升级、多方协同、开放生态共建以及知识产权保护等多个方面入手，以促进企业的数字化转型。</span></p><p><br/></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_r\"> <dl> <a href=\"874.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>展会 | GreatSQL精彩亮相GOTC 2025 共建开源数据库生态新未来</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"873.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>解决方案 | 200+系统信创改造！万里数据库助力中信银行信用卡中心实现高效平滑迁移</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"872.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>喜报｜中国移动中标三连！万里数据库彰显全域布局实力</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
